Flyback LED Driver Design
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs32 \cf0 \
\

\f2 Based on the research paper "A Single Stage Flyback Power Supply Unit for LED Lighting Applications," design a similar Critical Conduction Mode (CRM) flyback converter for a 100W LED street lighting application.
\f1 \

\f0\b \
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0 \cf0 \

\f3\b 1. Topic
\f2\b0 :\
 Critical Conduction Mode Flyback Converters, Power Factor Correction, LED Driver Design\
\

\f3\b 2. Problem: \

\f2\b0 Design a 100W single-stage Critical Conduction Mode (CRM) flyback converter for LED street lighting that achieves high power factor (>0.95) and efficiency (>85%) while providing stable constant current output for 28-series LED configuration from universal AC input (90-265 VAC).\
\

