\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Implement the power factor correction controller using FAN7530 IC functionality in Simulink with appropriate control algorithms\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Design constant current output regulation with isolated feedback and compensation network for stable operation\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Analyze MOSFET voltage stress and efficiency trade-offs through proper snubber design\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Simulate and validate system performance against specifications for power factor, efficiency, and output voltage ripple (<2%)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \

